Objective
To create and run a simple Jenkins pipeline without using Git or Docker.

Step 1: Open Jenkins Dashboard
Go to http://localhost:8080 and login.

Step 2: Create a New Pipeline Job
- Click on 'New Item'
- Enter job name: simple-pipeline
- Select 'Pipeline'
- Click OK

Step 3: Configure Pipeline Script

pipeline {
    agent any

    stages {
        stage('Hello') {
            steps {
                echo 'Hello World'
            }
        }
    }
}


Step 4: Run Pipeline

Click Build Now
